      "result": "Implemented the URL shortener API with Rails 8.0.2 and PostgreSQL persistence. `sh start.sh` applies pending migrations, then runs the server in the foreground on `0.0.0.0:8000`.\n\nLive HTTP checks passed for creation, listing, lookup, redirects and click counting, generated codes, validation errors, duplicate codes, malformed JSON, and data persisting after a server restart. Rails eager loading and the startup script syntax also passed.\n\n`rails test` could not load the test database because the provided `DATABASE_URL` points development and test at the same database; the starter contains no tests. The API was verified directly over HTTP instead.",
